(7558642, 1211449, 159132, '<td valign="top">Love the middle frame, but overall, I would have voted higher if<br/>* no resting train in the first frame (to emphasize arriving train)<br/>* no train at all (or stopped train) in third frame. I guess it is flying by or something. So not much difference from the 2nd frame. Perhaps also the chap could have turned and faced us, like following the train.<br/>Oh well - just my thoughts.</td>', 'Love the middle frame, but overall, I would have voted higher if* no resting train in the first frame (to emphasize arriving train)* no train at all (or stopped train) in third frame. I guess it is flying by or something. So not much difference from the 2nd frame. Perhaps also the chap could have turned and faced us, like following the train.Oh well - just my thoughts.', '2018-02-10 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
